71-25/39036621_908563686757648_5766878142044206530_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RQFb5VpoybkQ7kNvwE8HCD4&_nc_oc=Adrrm9x--o7FYhq5u6enwDJFpPASSyf-JtdxJ8DPoi6MwKHAFFVquJpmrhEZ8gWWNqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRolSs5NsCiAQRXkOChVSV7m8dgXnFuQwUWEZ0dds8W6w&oe=6B047CF5"}, "display_name": "Vortex VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Vortex VR is an immersive investigation and an narrative experience : You explore the universe of the VORTEX series. Help the commissioner (played by Tomer Sisley) to solve the crime !\n\n As a Detective, you can inspect the crime scene: hurry up! You'll only have 20 minutes to collect all the clues and solve the crime before the tide covers the evidence.\n\nFeatures: \n- Controlling time\n - Exploring and manipulating clues \n- Interactive narration \n- Actor Tomer Sisley in motion capture \n\nOnly available in French", "short_description": "An immersive investigation in the world of the TV show \"VORTEX\" : you have 20min to solve the crime ! \n\nA Narrative driven game \nONLY IN FRENCH - TEXT AND SPEECH "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "341414961763755", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vortex VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Vortex VR est une enqu\u00eate immersive o\u00f9 vous explorez l\u2019univers de la s\u00e9rie VORTEX. \u2028\u2028\n\nDans la peau d\u2019un detective vous pourrez inspecter la sc\u00e8ne de crime : d\u00e9p\u00eachez-vous ! \n\nVous n\u2019aurez que 20 minutes pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer tous les indices et \u00e9lucider le crime avant que la mar\u00e9e ne recouvre les preuves. \u2028\u2028\n\nFeatures : \n\u2028-Contr\u00f4ler le temps\u2028\n- Explorer et manipuler les indices\u2028\n- Narration interactive \n\u2028- Acteur Tomer Sisley en motion capture\u2028\u2028\n\nUniquement disponible en version fran\u00e7aise", "short_description": "Un